 "comments": [
  {
   "address": 40960,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Four 64-byte sprite records with pointers $83 through $80 in descending order. At animation count 6, $B6D2 assigns them to hardware sprites 0\u20133."
  },
  {
   "address": 41216,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Four records selected at animation count 3. At $B6EC, the code assigns pointers $87 through $84 to sprites 0\u20133."
  },
  {
   "address": 41472,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Four records assigned to sprites 0\u20133 when the leading sprite reaches X=$93. The top pair uses $8B/$8A, and the lower pair uses $89/$88."
  },
  {
   "address": 41728,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Four records left in place for sprites 4\u20137 by the ending setup. The upper pair uses $8D/$8C and the lower pair uses $8F/$8E."
  },
  {
   "address": 41984,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "One kilobyte of zeroes in the disk file. The first 1000 bytes are filled from the four map sections at $B000; the last eight entries include the sprite pointers written by the ending."
  },
  {
   "address": 43008,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Glyphs $00\u2013$1F, from which the ending map uses nine distinct codes in 162 cells."
  },
  {
   "address": 43264,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Glyphs $20\u2013$3F. Sixteen different codes in this span fill 454 cells of the ending map."
  },
  {
   "address": 43520,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Glyphs $40\u2013$5F. Seventeen distinct codes from this span occupy 90 cells in the ending."
  },
  {
   "address": 43776,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Glyphs $60\u2013$7F. The ending uses twelve of these codes in 30 cells."
  },
  {
   "address": 44032,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Glyphs $80\u2013$9F. Seven different codes from this page appear in 73 ending cells."
  },
  {
   "address": 44288,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Glyphs $A0\u2013$BF. Twelve different codes from this page furnish 163 cells."
  },
  {
   "address": 44544,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Glyphs $C0\u2013$DF. Three codes from this page are used in 28 ending cells."
  },
  {
   "address": 44800,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Glyphs $E0\u2013$FF. The 1000-cell ending map never selects any of these stored shapes."
  },
  {
   "address": 45056,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "First 250 character codes copied to $A400. The colour of each cell comes from the lookup table at $B400."
  },
  {
   "address": 45306,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Second group of 250 screen codes. $B55D copies them into the screen starting at $A4FA and fills the corresponding colour cells at $D8FA."
  },
  {
   "address": 45556,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Third group of 250 screen codes. $B56A copies them into the screen starting at $A5F4 and fills the colour cells at $D9F4."
  },
  {
   "address": 45806,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Last group of 250 screen codes. $B577 copies them into the screen starting at $A6EE and fills the colour cells at $DAEE."
  },
  {
   "address": 46056,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Twenty-four zero bytes between the end of the 1000 screen codes and the character colour lookup at $B400. The screen copy ends before this span."
  },
  {
   "address": 46080,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The ending renderer indexes this table with the screen character to select colour RAM values."
  },
  {
   "address": 46336,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Entry jump from the gameplay transition after ED has loaded. Calls the shared routine at $040E with X=0, then enters the ending setup at $B50B."
  },
  {
   "address": 46344,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Set when the moving figure reaches X=$93. The main loop waits for this byte to become nonzero before polling the fire buttons."
  },
  {
   "address": 46345,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Increased by the ending IRQ. Its low two bits divide the movement and animation updates."
  },
  {
   "address": 46346,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Increased at the quarter-rate step. Uses the second walk pose at 3 and switches to the first pose and resets the count at 6."
  },
  {
   "address": 46347,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Clears the ending's state, selects the VIC bank at $8000, display matrix at $A400 and character set at $A800. Sets black border and background and multicolours 9 and 8. Copies the ending character and colour data to the display."
  },
  {
   "address": 46675,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Acknowledges the VIC interrupt, calls the shared SID updater at $048D, steps the ending animation, and sets the raster compare back to line zero."
  },
  {
   "address": 46713,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Every second interrupt, moves sprites 0\u20133 one pixel right until X is $93. At that position installs the final pose and sets $B508, which allows either joystick's fire to return to the title."
  },
  {
   "address": 46779,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Every fourth interrupt while walking, advances the pose counter. Changes sprite pointers at counts 3 and 6, then resets the counter at 6."
  }
 ]
}